<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Document</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, sans-serif; }
  .header-title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .sub-header { font-size: 12pt; }
  .section-title { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .body-text { font-size: 10pt; line-height: 1.5; }
  .two-column { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  .column { width: 48%; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .form-group label { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold; }
  .form-group input[type="text"], .form-group textarea { width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-sizing: border-box; }
  .signature-block { margin-top: 50px; }
  .centered-text { text-align: center; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h2 class="header-title">I am interested in learning more about the <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span></h2>
      <p class="body-text" style="margin-top: 20px;">Please send me additional information regarding:</p>
      <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
        <li><span data-field="interest_1">{{ interest_1 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="interest_2">{{ interest_2 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="interest_3">{{ interest_3 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="interest_4">{{ interest_4 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="interest_5">{{ interest_5 }}</span></li>
        <li><span data-field="interest_6">{{ interest_6 }}</span></li>
      </ul>

      <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" value="{{ full_name }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="address">Address</label>
          <input type="text" id="address" value="{{ address }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="city_state_zip">City | State | Zip</label>
          <input type="text" id="city_state_zip" value="{{ city_state_zip }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="phone">Telephone Number</label>
          <input type="text" id="phone" value="{{ phone_number }}">
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email Address</label>
          <input type="text" id="email" value="{{ email_address }}">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
      <h1 class="header-title" style="font-size: 36pt;">DEFINE YOUR LEGACY TODAY</h1>
      <h2 class="header-title" style="font-size: 48pt; margin-top: -10px;">Canavan Legacy Society</h2>
      <div style="margin-top: 50px; text-align: center;">
        <img src="placeholder_image.png" alt="Legacy Image" style="width: 100%; max-width: 400px; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 auto;">
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;">A planned gift is more than an act of generosity; it is a commitment that is created now for the future benefit of Daemen College.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <img src="placeholder_photo.png" alt="Portrait" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
        <h3 class="body-text" style="margin-top: 15px;">"Rosary Hill College prepared me for a fulfilling life, both personally and in my career. I want Daemen College students to have the same opportunities that were afforded to me. My contribution will help make that happen."</h3>
        <p class="body-text" style="margin-top: 30px;"><strong>{{ full_name }}</strong><br>
        Class of {{ graduation_year }}<br>
        Canavan Society Member</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="width: 48%;">WAYS TO GIVE</h2>
        <div style="width: 48%; text-align: right;">
          <h2 class="section-title">CHARITABLE REMAINDER TRUSTS</h2>
          <p class="body-text">Charitable remainder trusts are similar to other legal trusts in that assets and/or property are held by one entity for the benefit of another. The differentiating factor in Charitable Remainder Trusts is that the beneficiary is a charitable organization. Charitable Remainder Trusts offer great flexibility because of the many types available and the option to make them effective during life or at death. Charitable remainder trusts are often reserved for gifts larger than $150,000 because they require legal and financial counsel to be established.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="width: 48%;">GIFTS OF RETIREMENT ASSETS</h2>
        <div style="width: 48%; text-align: right;">
          <h2 class="section-title">REAL ESTATE GIFTS</h2>
          <p class="body-text">Make a gift of real estate to Daemen College to maximize the impact of your giving without affecting your current financial situation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="width: 48%;">APPRECIATED SECURITIES</h2>
        <div style="width: 48%; text-align: right;">
          <h2 class="section-title">LIFE INSURANCE</h2>
          <p class="body-text">Name Daemen College as owner and beneficiary of an insurance policy (new or existing), which can generate an income tax deduction. Or purchase a new policy to replace the value of another asset you give to Daemen. Life insurance is a great way to make a significant and transformational gift to Daemen College.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h2 class="section-title" style="width: 48%;">BEQUESTS</h2>
        <div style="width: 48%; text-align: right;">
          <h2 class="section-title">CANAVAN SOCIETY MEMBERS RECEIVE:</h2>
          <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li><span data-field="member_benefit_1">{{ member_benefit_1 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="member_benefit_2">{{ member_benefit_2 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="member_benefit_3">{{ member_benefit_3 }}</span></li>
            <li><span data-field="member_benefit_4">{{ member_benefit_4 }}</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <h3 class="section-title">PLEASE RETURN TO:</h3>
        <p class="body-text">The Office of Institutional Advancement<br>
        <span data-field="office_address_line_1">{{ office_address_line_1 }}</span><br>
        <span data-field="office_phone">{{ office_phone }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
      <div style="margin-top: 100px;">
        <h1 class="header-title" style="font-size: 40pt;">DAEMEN</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>